{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21932","headline":"京兆府新栽莲 · 白居易","name":"京兆府新栽莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汚沟贮浊水，水上叶田田。\n我来一长叹，知是东溪莲。\n下有青泥汚，馨香无复全。\n上有红尘扑，颜色不得鲜。\n物性犹如此，人事亦宜然。\n托根非其所，不如遭弃捐。\n昔在溪中日，花叶媚清涟。\n今来不得地，顦顇府门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}